  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Mentre» with two continuing actions",
     "texto": [
      "When two processes were happening at the same time in the past, both go in the **imperfetto**: **Mentre cucinavo, ascoltavo la musica** (while I was cooking, I was listening to music); **Mentre io lavoravo, i bambini dormivano** (while I was working, the children were sleeping)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Mentre» with an interrupting action",
     "texto": [
      "If a single action interrupts what was happening, the background action goes with **mentre + imperfetto** and the single action goes in the **passato prossimo**: **Mentre cucinavo, è suonato il telefono** (while I was cooking, the phone rang)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Time combinations with «mentre» and «quando»",
